# Lists every API key owned by the authenticated Tenant — including each
# key's full secret value (retrievable anytime, not shown once).

### Happy path (replace with a real access_token from tenancy.login.rest)
GET http://localhost:8080/tenants/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### No credential — expect 401
GET http://localhost:8080/tenants/api-keys
